== strategist mission invoke
use: invoke
short: Invoke one embedded Weapon through a host bridge
flag: --context (string) default="" usage="original user request supplied to an explicit host bridge"
flag: --host (string) default="" usage="execute through host (codex or claude); omit to emit the request"
flag: --json (bool) default="false" usage="emit machine-readable JSON"
flag: --mission-id (string) default="" usage="mission identifier (required)"
flag: --role (string) default="ranger" usage="Role to invoke"
